WEBVTT

00:00:00.549 --> 00:00:02.549
Step 1: Navigate to the app home page

00:00:01.472 --> 00:00:03.472
Step 2: Fill in a display name

00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:04.929
Step 3: Open the Apple workspace

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:10.956
Step 4: Select an existing note from the sidebar to open it in the editor

00:00:10.956 --> 00:00:12.956
Step 5: Click Share note

00:00:12.736 --> 00:00:14.736
Step 6: Verify the Share URL field is populated with a valid link

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.013
Step 7: Click Copy URL

00:00:14.743 --> 00:00:17.077
Step 8: Click Close to dismiss share dialog
